WEBVTT

00:00:59.082 --> 00:01:03.402
North? South? East?
West? Loisfoeribari?

00:01:03.402 --> 00:01:07.672
I try, over and over, to read 
the word out loud.

00:01:07.676 --> 00:01:10.052
Loisfoeribari.

00:01:10.052 --> 00:01:12.112
LoISFOeribari.

00:01:12.112 --> 00:01:13.962
LoiSFOEribari.

00:01:13.962 --> 00:01:16.002
LoisFOERibARI.

00:01:16.002 --> 00:01:19.772
What is this word?
I imagine using it in sentences like,

00:01:19.772 --> 00:01:23.662
“Man, I have to go back to the house,
I forgot my Loisfoeribari.”

00:01:23.662 --> 00:01:27.772
or “There’s nothing 
better than rain, hot rain,

00:01:27.772 --> 00:01:33.052
open windows with music,
and a tall glass of Loisfoeribari.”